Incompressible flow past a deforming circle that mimics the growth of ice


(1) Build some  grids:
    ogen -noplot circleDeformGrid -interp=e -factor=2
    ogen -noplot circleDeformGrid -interp=e -factor=2
    ogen -noplot circleDeformGrid -interp=e -factor=4

(2) Run interactively:

cgins circleDeform -g=circleDeformGride2.order2.hdf -dg=ice -nu=.02 -tf=2.0 -tp=0.1 -model=ins -go=halt

(3) Run in batch and save a show file

cgins -noplot circleDeform -g=circleDeformGride5.order2.hdf -dg=ice -deformFrequency=0.5 -nu=.002 -tf=20.0 -tp=.01 -model=ins -show=iceDeform5.show -go=go > iceDeform5.out & 

(4) Plot results from the show file:

  plotStuff plotCircleDeform.cmd -show=iceDeform5.show -vorMin=-50 -vorMax=50 
